THE FLORIDA SHOOTING IN THE

00:01:05.501 --> 00:01:09.772
ISSUE OF HOW TO KEEP GUNS OUT OF

00:01:07.703 --> 00:01:10.206
THE HANDS OF KILLERS FRONT AND

00:01:09.906 --> 00:01:13.209
