00:01:56.152 --> 00:01:58.988
THOSE WHO SACRIFICED THEIR LIVES

00:01:58.421 --> 00:02:01.057
LAST WEEK.

00:01:59.122 --> 00:02:02.625
&gt;&gt; IN THE AFTERMATH OF THIS EVIL

00:02:01.190 --> 00:02:07.163
