00:02:39.296 --> 00:02:41.364
WE MUST ACTUALLY MAKE A

00:02:41.097 --> 00:02:42.599
DIFFERENCE.

00:02:41.498 --> 00:02:44.301
&gt;&gt; THE PRESIDENT WILL HOLD

00:02:42.732 --> 00:02:45.202
